Summarises what one session did, by tool, with its error count beside each.

The id may be the full session id. Run 'telepathy agents' for the ones running now,
or query v_session for the ones that have ended.

Usage:
  telepathy session <id> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for session

Global Flags:
      --projects string   the transcript root, which this reads and never writes (default "~/.claude/projects")
      --sessions string   where the client advertises live sessions, which is the only source of liveness (default "~/.claude/sessions")
      --store string      the catalogue database the hooks write and every read verb queries (default "$XDG_STATE_HOME/special-circumstances/catalogue/catalogue.db")
